title: "OneWare Container Extension"
abstract: >-
  A modular plugin for OneWare Studio that enables transparent,
  containerized execution of FPGA toolchains via the Hybrid Strategy
  Pattern. Supports Docker, Podman, Colima, and OrbStack.
